00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.038277,108.202626 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.036142,108.202930 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.030835,108.203684 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.029362,108.203879 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.029184,108.202510 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.028487,108.202603 0 15
00:00:00.00>VDN801 ADDWPT 16.029200,108.202500 0 25
00:00:00.00>VDN801 LNAV ON
00:00:00.00>VDN801 VNAV ON

